Description: Package will allow for various types of functions and graphing suited
             to interpret Health Data. Mainly this package contributes towards
             analyzing blood pressure values and categorizing into a specific category.
             This allows for an easier time to differentiate patient populations and 
             organizing a dataset with attributes including blood pressure units. 
